        "name": "USN-8914-1",
        "description": "It was discovered that the Go x/net/idna package, vendored in Google Guest Agent and Google OS Config Agent, incorrectly accepted Punycode-encoded labels that decoded to ASCII-only labels when processing internationalized domain names. A remote attacker could possibly use this issue to bypass hostname-based access controls and escalate privileges.",
